SQL> -- INTENT:
SQL> -- Purpose: Define the ORDS modules, templates and handlers for the framework scaffold.
SQL> -- Approach: Invoke each module create script plus its privileges script under api/modules/.
SQL> -- Reason: ORDS metadata is versioned as code rather than configured by hand, so a
